  "display_title": "Reason For Avoiding The Perfect Man",
  "description": "\"*Anyone but this man — absolutely not! So why is he so needlessly beautiful and kind?\"*\n\nYoon-Ji suddenly finds herself inside the world of a novel she was writing.The pen name \\[Marie\\], which only she knew, is now the name everyone calls her. Now living as a beautiful young woman, she dreams of experiencing a sweet romance, but of all people, she ends up entangled with the second prince Henrique, a man destined for ruin!\n\n *\"Have I piqued your interest or something?\"*\n\nWhere did it all go wrong?\n\nA full-fledged survival romance in another world begins!\n\n(Source: Kakaopage, translated)",
